{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：18:00 2026-09-28 HKT</p>\n\n<p>法國知名時尚品牌Maison Kitsuné憑藉融合法式優雅與日系街頭的獨特設計，一直深受全球潮人與時尚愛好者追捧。最近，品牌宣布與網購折扣平台OnTheList合作推出優惠，多款精選服飾及配件低至3折即可入手，記得趁優惠入手秋冬服飾！</p>\n<h2>Maison Kitsuné 「狐狸仔」秋冬服飾3折起</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86218176f389bbc93956b9aca504afa1/2026-09/1_3_9.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e38509f691087ae15bf8ae517aac96f/2026-09/2_0_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09a74bda628890eb358f9ca756f5d350/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_16_39_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7b63fc50c05def83eded67c8610e9d3/2026-09/3_3_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ab8d07fbc5ac84690587e805cd50005/2026-09/4_22.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53a874d8b003cd05693774b5821a85cb/2026-09/5_1_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df7eead241f3e3b6e8abe8935816b262/2026-09/6_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16ab158a284ad43421e0fbff02213345/2026-09/7_1_8.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/168bf2849cb130a124f56df5f00ab6a7/2026-09/8_0_3.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8baccfe810ad25b509162fa15739351f/2026-09/9_2_6.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee829c0153201ed44f2145ba8a798594/2026-09/10_6.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fa7240efa44b41b03e55b2754c2855e/2026-09/11_0_8.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f42fbf2558a856fdbeeaecb503e2fe3/2026-09/12_0_6.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21837ed46bba3ad11d8e3f94675b623c/2026-09/13_0_5.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d76ae72d0db6b37154bdc47cd242cca/2026-09/14_0_5.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d546353625d9258892e04e61edd7027/2026-09/15_0_5.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba34062df3024ae9e92152047db43963/2026-09/16_0_4.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dee8badf70e711d6e9074b4349595bad/2026-09/17_0_3.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4458651ae78b6871ad36e03f00aac88e/2026-09/18_5.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bb61b8f733aa0879b2756274c96cf64/2026-09/19_4.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4b09099c26c3e7d5292b7bda9d647f6/2026-09/20_1_4.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71d4d6635e9223987aa42c15b66aa555/2026-09/21_7.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98f2b60a8c912bc476f4bf979220ee0e/2026-09/22_9.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0749276b8f1b57029bdd59151bd6be0/2026-09/23_6.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f596e2cc6be776d0f7794f59c74234e3/2026-09/24_6.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95fd4d87c3975c0221bc28dc4d6658c1/2026-09/25_3.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe5c6c688cf60c06fc35c5face8f1123/2026-09/26_3.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18bbf34a40a0276fcf9edbcaa285d52d/2026-09/27_2.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e98439c82e3c8967e158de93fa7269b5/2026-09/28_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ad4814b5baca0be1ada03562364266f/2026-09/29_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2ad9c5db18872b08d5541cff08f0641/2026-09/30_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2104351be02e97d2a51bd15632fd483/2026-09/31_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e1c48ff3b64aee28a4f5f83168a3eeb/2026-09/32_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64e85d8f76f6b5992aa4138f1fc4d643/2026-09/33_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c89fa6a6d66f1c9f4b7db7db373190c1/2026-09/34_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a96b9422ab3b22ad139a1508b904913/2026-09/35_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7268d27a6f82377b72269ade09a86fb/2026-09/36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c31b1b9915f5e1bf0d8b76c157cfb1d7/2026-09/37_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/633295bff8202575671c6e004f051320/2026-09/38_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acc339625817cf75a5ef72f7da3bfd61/2026-09/39_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e249e8ef8f2e1f354aba158de4377f17/2026-09/40_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15acd07fe5bf9bbb3fb1af6dbdee9478/2026-09/41_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/502c1bbbcb18b15fb7c53b35704d0cc7/2026-09/42_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54a7ab24e7c836315bec4322dc8eb1ae/2026-09/43_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8dce927a43267411a244eedc0cc6302/2026-09/44_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e7cd8850441ef4dfba3c61eb0b8bea2/2026-09/45_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae2b1a4663df059c25d0ba4106e13e70/2026-09/46_0.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Maison Kitsuné由Gildas Loaëc與Masaya Kuroki於2002年在巴黎創立，完美融合巴黎優雅與東京街頭文化，打造出兼具舒適質感與玩味風格的時裝系列。今次Maison Kitsuné聯同OnTheList購物平台推出開倉優惠，無論是日常百搭的短袖 T 恤、版型俐落的長褲，還是氣質十足的Polo衫與連身裙，均以低至3折公開發售！</p>\n<p>其中，休閒必備的T恤、長褲以及經典Polo衫分別售$450和$500；女裝方面，半身裙、連身裙與俐落恤衫價格由$600至$650不等；至於秋冬服飾，各式衛衣、連帽衛衣、圓領衛衣與經典針織衫，折後價介乎$800至$950；若想入手保暖外套或質感大衣，亦只需$1,400至$1,500即可輕鬆帶回家，絕對是換季買新衫的絕佳時機。</p>\n<h2>$150起入手時尚配飾/人氣包款</h2>\n<p>另外，多款品牌的時尚配飾及配件，折後只需$150起；或以$250起的入手手袋款及鞋履，記得趁優惠入手！</p>\n<p>Maison Kitsuné開倉開售時段與入場指南</p>\n<ul>\n<li>活動地點：OnTheList 陳列室（太古坊濠豐大廈 4 樓）</li>\n<li>開售時段（付費會員）：9 月 28 日 08:00</li>\n<li>開售時段（Standard 會員）：\t<ul><li>9 月 28 日：13:00 - 21:00</li><li>9 月 29 日：08:00 - 21:00</li><li>9 月 30 日：10:00 - 21:00</li><li>10 月 1 日至 10 月 2 日：10:00 - 20:00</li><li>10 月 3 日：10:00 - 18:00</li></ul></li>\n<li>*需預先免費登記成為 OnTheList 會員，網址按此</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T10:19:13.373896+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":840,"images":47,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}